&lt;p&gt;We built &lt;strong&gt;Touch Grass: Community Swap-Meet &amp;amp; Local Event Matchmaker (Comm-Swap)&lt;/strong&gt;—an open-source, 100% offline-first web application designed to break people out of endless screen doomscrolling and connect neighbors for real-world physical item and skill barters in public outdoor spaces (community gardens, park gazebos, and library courtyards).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Instead of relying on corporate cloud servers, telemetry trackers, and commercial shipping, Comm-Swap empowers neighborhoods to run their own local barter networks completely self-hosted, offline, and private.&lt;/p&gt;

